<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your diverted flight from {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}&nbsp;on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If technical/weather use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As you are aware, <b><i>-poor weather/a mechanical issue/a medical emergency onboard- </i></b>meant we had to divert the aircraft operating QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} to <b><i>-DIVERSION PORT-</i></b>. We understand the impact this unforeseen stop had on your arrival time, but when it comes to your safety we never take any chances.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If due to unruly customer use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As you are aware, QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} to divert to<b><i> -DIVERSION PORT-</i></b> to offload an unruly passenger for <b><i>-poor/threatening-</i></b> behaviour towards other customers and crew. While we understand the impact this unforeseen stop had on your arrival time, we have a zero tolerance approach for anti-social behaviour and any actions that could compromise the safety of anyone on our aircraft.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If poorly handled add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We know the importance of communication in situations like this and I regret our airport team did not manage this delay as well as expected. I can assure you that we are committed to improving our delay handling processes, when unforeseen issues occur, and customer feedback plays an important role in this process. Your first-hand experience is vital to developing this aspect of our service so we are grateful you let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If gesture due tier add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If a Frequent Flyer:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to arrange a credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to you. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email, so we can credit points to your account. If you are not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></font></p><p style=""><br></p><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting compensation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">You will need to refer any unexpected costs to your travel insurance provider. If you require any additional information about the delay to make a claim through your policy, please let me know and I would be happy to provide this for you.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you again for taking the time to write. We are putting every effort into minimising delays and I hope you’ll see the difference the next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>